t known yet.\\n\\nI need to create a calendar list using absolute date-time with an offset while querying a UTC day range. I’ll look for events on the exact date, and ensure I select local time accurately when possible.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Setting date boundaries for events**\\n\\nI’m establishing a full UTC day range to cover all time zones, listing from November 9, 2026, at 00:00 UTC to November 12, 2026, at 00:00 UTC. This lets me identify tomorrow's events while considering local offsets. Since the email today is November 9, I’ll gather a calendar list and read the events to determine the correct time zone. I’ll search for events from November 9 through November 11 and return the details needed.\"}]},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_06dd2e904fb3a7cb016af1293b7ca887d0af5008dcb12207cb\",\"call_id\":\"call_zrMn4DXsevzgoVacJ0ZPZGeM\",\"name\":\"calendar\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"list\\\",\\\"from\\\":\\\"2026-11-09T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"to\\\":\\\"2026-11-12T00:00:00Z\\\",\\\"limit\\\":100}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_zrMn4DXsevzgoVacJ0ZPZGeM\",\"output\":\"{\\n  \\\"events\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"event\\\": \\\"evt_84fd03db270b46ee\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Team standup\\\",\\n      \\\"start\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T09:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"end\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T09:15:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"time_zone\\\": \\\"UTC\\\",\\n      \\\"organizer\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"lee@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Lee Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"response\\\": \\\"accepted\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"event\\\": \\\"evt_0904f6e8f33b492a\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Q3 planning review\\\",\\n      \\\"start\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T14:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"end\\\": \\\"2026-11-10T15:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"time_zone\\\": \\\"UTC\\\",\\n      \\\"location\\\": \\\"Room 4\\\",\\n      \\\"organizer\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name