t_part.done\",\"content_index\":0,\"item_id\":\"msg_06dd2e904fb3a7cb016af12949bf3087d0ab64840543dc3718\",\"output_index\":1,\"part\":{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"annotations\":[],\"logprobs\":[],\"text\":\"Tomorrow, **Tuesday, November 10** (times in UTC), you have:\\n- **Team standup:** 9:00–9:15 AM\\n- **Q3 planning review:** 2:00–3:00 PM, Room 4\\n\\nYes—Dana emailed asking you to bring the latest budget sheet to the planning review, specifically for Finance’s Q3 travel line. I found the **Q3 Budget** spreadsheet: [Open the sheet](https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget).\\n\\nI drafted a reply to Dana with the link saying you’ll bring it. **It’s saved as a draft and has not been sent.**\"},\"sequence_number\":143}\n\nevent: response.output_item.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_item.done\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"msg_06dd2e904fb3a7cb016af12949bf3087d0ab64840543dc3718\",\"type\":\"message\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"annotations\":[],\"logprobs\":[],\"text\":\"Tomorrow, **Tuesday, November 10** (times in UTC), you have:\\n- **Team standup:** 9:00–9:15 AM\\n- **Q3 planning review:** 2:00–3:00 PM, Room 4\\n\\nYes—Dana emailed asking you to bring the latest budget sheet to the planning review, specifically for Finance’s Q3 travel line. I found the **Q3 Budget** spreadsheet: [Open the sheet](https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget).\\n\\nI drafted a reply to Dana with the link saying you’ll bring it. **It’s saved as a draft and has not been sent.**\"}],\"phase\":\"final_answer\",\"role\":\"assistant\"},\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":144}\n\nevent: response.completed\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.completed\",\"response\":{\"id\":\"resp_06dd2e904fb3a7cb016af12946884887d0a247d54b81216b35\",\"object\":\"response\",\"created_at\":1794189638,\"status\":\"completed\",\"access_programs\":null,\"background\":false,\"completed_at\":1794189642,\"error\":null,\"frequency_penalty\":0.0,\"image\":{\"context_compressi